@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title EatingHalal — framework and responsibility boundaries
package "View / presentation" #EDF2DB {
  [React App and Entry components] as View
}
package "Spring MVC / controller layer" #E7EFF8 {
  [Spring Security session and CSRF filters] as Security
  [DispatcherServlet] as Dispatcher
  [REST controllers] as Controllers
}
package "Model / application layer" #EDF2DB {
  [ProductLookupService] as Lookup
  [AssessmentService — stored results only] as Assessment
  [ShoppingListService] as List
  [JPA domain entities] as Entities
  [Spring Data repositories] as Repositories
  [OpenFoodFactsClient — optional] as External
}
database PostgreSQL
cloud "Open Food Facts" as OFF
View --> Security : HTTP / JSON / multipart
Security --> Dispatcher
Dispatcher --> Controllers
Controllers --> Lookup
Controllers --> Assessment
Controllers --> List
Lookup --> External
Lookup --> Repositories
Assessment --> Repositories
List --> Repositories
Repositories --> Entities
Repositories --> PostgreSQL : JDBC
External --> OFF : HTTPS
note bottom of Assessment
No automatic halal verdict generation.
Synthetic seeded results are clearly labelled.
end note
note bottom of Controllers
PhotoController returns unavailable;
OCR is not implemented.
end note
@enduml
